Every opioid-policy-setter should not impose a rigid-dose-standard and should not impose a rigid-duration-standard and should not impose a performance-incentive.
Every opioid-policy-setter should ensure a taper-protective-threshold-policy.
Every opioid-policy-setter should not penalize a clinician during a high-dosage-patient-acceptance.
Every opioid-policy-setter should not penalize a clinician during a long-term-opioid-taper-restraint.
